Computational Intelligence Algorithms
=====================================

This work contains a collection of computational implementations of classical algorithms in
Optimization, Machine Learning, and Linear Algebra. The project is structured as a set of
independent modules, each focusing on a specific problem or class of methods.

Introduction
------------

The objective of this work is to explore and implement fundamental algorithms from different
domains, emphasizing:
- Mathematical modeling
- Algorithmic problem solving
- From-scratch implementations
- Visualization of results (when applicable)
Each module is self-contained and demonstrates a specific technique or family of algorithms.

